  "clips": {
    "TK1": {
      "id": "TK1",
      "title": "The Ken & Barbie Facade and Suburban Blind Spots",
      "theme": "The Halo Effect & Suburban Blind Spots",
      "psychological_signs": [
        1,
        9
      ],
      "hook": "A real-life Ken and Barbie couple. Why was the entire town completely blinded?",
      "bgm": "bgm_piano_minimal.mp3",
      "bgm_desc": "Act 1 — episode bed: bgm_piano_minimal.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_wind_cold.wav (bed)",
        "fx_door_close.wav",
        "fx_stinger.wav"
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#1",
          "text": "57 BAYVIEW DRIVE · PORT DALHOUSIE",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "text": "REAL-LIFE KEN & BARBIE FACADE",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "text": "PERFECT NEIGHBORHOOD BLIND SPOT",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "text": "THE HALO EFFECT & SUBURBAN ILLUSION",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#1",
          "orig_id": "1.03#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_pink_house_57_bayview",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "In the early 1990s, in the scenic lakeside community of Port Dalhousie in Ontario, an eye-catching pink house stood at 57 Bayview Drive.",
          "dur_est": 8.25
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#2",
          "orig_id": "1.03#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_paul_bernardo_dashing_car",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The husband was Paul Bernardo, a handsome financial accounting professional who always wore designer suits and drove a sleek convertible sports car.",
          "dur_est": 7.89
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#3",
          "orig_id": "1.03#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_karla_veterinary_clinic",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The wife was Karla Homolka, six years his junior, a striking blonde with an angelic smile who worked at a local veterinary clinic.",
          "dur_est": 8.25
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#4",
          "orig_id": "1.03#5",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_ken_barbie_golden_illusion",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "To the surrounding suburban neighborhood, they were the living embodiment of the golden couple, Ken and Barbie.",
          "dur_est": 6.1
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#5",
          "orig_id": "1.06#1",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_suburban_admiration_facade",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "To all of us in that lakeside neighborhood, Paul and Karla were an exemplary golden couple.",
          "dur_est": 5.07
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#6",
          "orig_id": "1.06#4",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.04,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_closed_pink_door_abyss",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Their holy facade blinded the entire neighborhood completely.",
          "dur_est": 2.54
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#7",
          "orig_id": "1.07#1",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_expert_desk_lamp",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Under the lens of social psychology, the facade of the pink house at 57 Bayview Drive represents a textbook study in the Halo Effect and Suburban Blindness.",
          "dur_est": 10.64
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#8",
          "orig_id": "1.07#4",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "bg": "t11_pink_house_winter_dusk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "We readily guard ourselves against a disheveled, suspicious figure lurking in a dark alley, yet remain thoroughly defenseless before a middle-class couple strolling their dog with radiant smiles beside a rose trellis.",
          "dur_est": 12.61
        },
        {
          "id": "TK1.01#9",
          "orig_id": "CTA",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "bg": "t11_amber_eyes_closing_dossier_bernardo",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode eleven of Amber Eyes. Watch the full dossier via the link in our bio.",
          "dur_est": 5.38
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK2": {
      "id": "TK2",
      "title": "Escalation Trajectory — 4 Stages of Moral Degradation",
      "theme": "Fantasy Escalation Trajectory & MO vs Signature",
      "psychological_signs": [
