      ],
      "hook": "From suburban night prowler to broad daylight church abductions. How did the predation escalate?",
      "bgm": "bgm_cell_dark.mp3",
      "bgm_desc": "Act 2 — episode bed: bgm_cell_dark.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_night_highway.wav (bed)",
