          "dur_s": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#1",
          "orig_id": "2.04#1",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_investigation_board_four_stages",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Based on inter-agency investigative data, we reconstructed Paul Bernardo's trajectory of moral degeneration across four distinct stages of escalation.",
          "dur_est": 8.2
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#2",
          "orig_id": "2.04#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "bg": "t11_scarborough_nocturnal_shadow",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Rung One: Solitary predatory ambushes in suburban enclaves.",
          "dur_est": 3.45
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#3",
          "orig_id": "2.04#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_scarborough_night_street_lurking",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Starting in May 1987, Paul Bernardo stalked and assaulted at least fourteen young women in Scarborough, operating alone and escaping into the night.",
          "dur_est": 9.92
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#4",
          "orig_id": "2.04#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "bg": "t11_silent_christmas_tragedy",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Rung Two: Establishing the predatory alliance and violating family.",
          "dur_est": 3.88
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#5",
          "orig_id": "2.04#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.04,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_christmas_1990_halothane_bottle",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "In October 1987, he met Karla Homolka; their deviant bond led them to target Karla's own fifteen-year-old sister, Tammy Homolka, on Christmas Eve 1990 using stolen veterinary anesthetics, resulting in the girl's tragic death.",
          "dur_est": 14.67
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#6",
          "orig_id": "2.04#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "bg": "t11_closed_pink_door_abyss",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Rung Three: Prolonged residential captivity at their private home.",
          "dur_est": 3.88
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#7",
          "orig_id": "2.04#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_bayview_basement_concrete",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "In June 1991, following their wedding, they abducted Leslie Mahaffy, holding her captive and abusing her inside 57 Bayview Drive before ending her life.",
          "dur_est": 10.35
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#8",
          "orig_id": "2.04#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "bg": "t11_church_parking_daytime_abduction",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "And Rung Four: Brazen daytime public abduction.",
          "dur_est": 3.02
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#9",
          "orig_id": "2.04#9",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_church_parking_lot_ambush",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "In April 1992, they ambushed Kristen French in a busy Saint Catharines church parking lot in broad daylight, proving that omnipotent hubris had completely eclipsed the fear of detection.",
          "dur_est": 12.51
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#10",
          "orig_id": "2.04#12",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "bg": "t11_coupled_shadows_mirror",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "It marked the terrifying transformation from a solitary prowler into an organized, lethal serial predation team.",
          "dur_est": 6.9
        },
        {
          "id": "TK2.01#11",
          "orig_id": "CTA",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "bg": "t11_amber_eyes_closing_dossier_bernardo",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode eleven of Amber Eyes. Watch the full dossier via the link in our bio.",
          "dur_est": 5.38
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK3": {
      "id": "TK3",
      "title": "Folie à Deux & Dehumanization Mechanisms",
      "theme": "Shared Psychotic Disorder (Folie à Deux) & Dehumanization of Kin",
      "psychological_signs": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "hook": "Why would an educated young woman offer her own biological sister as a sacrificial token?",
      "bgm": "bgm_cello_sad_v2.mp3",
      "bgm_desc": "Act 3 — episode bed: bgm_cello_sad_v2.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_sub_drone.wav (bed)",
        "fx_heartbeat_slow.wav",
        "fx_stinger.wav"
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "after_id": "TK3.01#1",
          "text": "SHARED MADNESS: FOLIE À DEUX",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "text": "LETHAL PSYCHOLOGICAL ECHO CHAMBER",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "text": "DEHUMANIZATION & PROJECTION",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "text": "THE BREAKING POINT: JANUARY 1993",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#1",
          "orig_id": "3.04#1",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_folie_a_deux_resonance",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The foundational clinical framework that elucidates this dynamic is Shared Psychotic Disorder, historically known as Folie à Deux.",
          "dur_est": 7.09
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#2",
          "orig_id": "3.04#2",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_coupled_shadows_mirror",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "This is a rare clinical manifestation where two individuals with complementary character pathologies intersect, creating a mutual resonance chamber of crime.",
          "dur_est": 8.28
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#3",
          "orig_id": "3.04#3",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_destructive_flame_alliance",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Within this partnership, Paul Bernardo served as the primary inducer, characterized by malignant narcissism and antisocial psychopathy.",
          "dur_est": 6.7
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#4",
          "orig_id": "3.04#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_obedient_accomplice_strings",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Rather than recoiling when Paul's predatory compulsions surfaced, Karla discovered in him vicarious power arousal and blind emotional subservience.",
          "dur_est": 7.49
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#5",
          "orig_id": "3.05#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_cracked_mirror_hallway",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "This toxic symbiosis precipitated an excruciatingly callous cognitive phenomenon: the complete objectification of their victims.",
          "dur_est": 5.38
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#6",
          "orig_id": "3.05#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.04,
          "pause_after": 0.8,
          "bg": "t11_silent_christmas_tragedy",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "How could Karla cold-bloodedly deliver her own flesh-and-blood younger sister into this fatal trap?",
          "dur_est": 5.02
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#7",
          "orig_id": "3.06#1",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_featureless_peg_dolls",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The core psychological mechanisms here are objectification and dehumanization.",
          "dur_est": 3.55
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#8",
          "orig_id": "3.06#2",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_covert_sociopath_profile",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Paul Bernardo viewed victims as disposable playthings designed solely to feed his addiction to dominance and sexual sadism.",
          "dur_est": 7.09
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#9",
          "orig_id": "3.08#1",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_flashlight_shattered_hallway",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "However, every criminal alliance eventually encounters its internal breaking point.",
          "dur_est": 4.31
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#10",
          "orig_id": "3.08#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "bg": "t11_escape_to_parents_porch",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Just one month later, on February 17, 1993, police closed in to arrest Paul Bernardo.",
          "dur_est": 6.47
        },
        {
          "id": "TK3.01#11",
          "orig_id": "CTA",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "bg": "t11_amber_eyes_closing_dossier_bernardo",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode eleven of Amber Eyes. Watch the full dossier via the link in our bio.",
          "dur_est": 5.38
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK4": {
