        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "TK4.01#1",
          "orig_id": "4.08#1",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_deal_with_the_devil_contract",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "And that judicial catastrophe became all the more bitter due to the moral agony of those holding the decisive evidence.",
          "dur_est": 8.63
        },
        {
          "id": "TK4.01#2",
          "orig_id": "4.10#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_dark_screening_room_projector",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "When the projector was switched on inside the locked Crown conference room, the entire room was engulfed in horrified silence.",
          "dur_est": 8.63
        },
        {
          "id": "TK4.01#3",
          "orig_id": "4.10#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.04,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_investigator_nausea_monitor",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The footage on that screen utterly decimated the fragile victim narrative Karla Homolka had so meticulously fabricated.",
          "dur_est": 7.33
        },
        {
          "id": "TK4.01#4",
          "orig_id": "4.11#1",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.04,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_dark_screening_room_projector",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Picture the agonizing humiliation of Crown prosecutors sitting in that darkened room that afternoon.",
          "dur_est": 5.32
        },
        {
          "id": "TK4.01#5",
          "orig_id": "4.11#2",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.04,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "bg": "t11_interrogation_bruised_facade",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "We had believed the tearful testimony of a trembling woman who claimed she was terrorized under duress.",
          "dur_est": 6.46
        },
        {
          "id": "TK4.01#6",
          "orig_id": "4.11#3",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.03,
          "pause_after": 0.7,
          "bg": "t11_six_tapes_on_floor",
          "motion": "pull",
